'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a helmet in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
The [[Armor#Helmet-0|helmet]] was awarded to all Helldivers who have participated in any stage of the [[Campaigns#Void Piercer|Void Piercer Campaign]].

== Trivia ==
* The {{PAGENAME}} is the second helmet that could be received as a campaign reward, with the first one being the [[KDM-500 Outrider]].
* The IX-Voidwalker vaguely resembles the armor of Isaac Clark, the main protagonist of the [[wikipedia:Dead Space|''Dead Space'' Franchise]].
** The helmet also evokes the colors and horizontal, three-banded visor of the [[Elevated Overseer]]'s helmet.

== Known Issues ==
*The {{PAGENAME}} disappears in certain camera angles while performing specific actions.

